        "char_doctor_yin_xuan",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Earth shell snail mucus must be sealed and stored within ten breaths, or the fluid dries and loses its effect. Star night mucus is produced by processing the ordinary mucus on the spot with Fang Yuan’s special methods: processing takes seven breaths, and sealing after that must finish within three breaths. Because of those windows, he insists on entering Earth Trench rather than relying on stored ordinary mucus.",
      "chapters": [
        930
      ],
